## Run

```bash
# tests
uv run pytest {{FOLDER}}/tests -q

# the service
uv run uvicorn api:app --app-dir {{FOLDER}} --port {{PORT}}

# one-off from the CLI
uv run python -m src.run --as-of "2027-08-02T06:00:00+05:30" --out outputs/
```

## API

```bash
curl localhost:{{PORT}}/health
curl localhost:{{PORT}}/metadata

curl -X POST localhost:{{PORT}}/predict -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{}'

curl -X POST localhost:{{PORT}}/predict -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{
  "as_of": "2027-08-02T06:00:00+05:30",
  "horizon_min": {{DEFAULT_HORIZON}},
